## Interface: 16001
## Title: Pace's Quality of Life
## Notes: Small conveniences for WoW Forever: track or untrack every quest (or a whole zone) from the quest log, filter Looking For Group players by role, a quest tracker that follows your zone, who's in a community voice channel before you join it, each person's voice volume kept, party members' pets on the party frames, and each computer its own Edit Mode layout. Each can be switched off.
